      "npc" : "Hugel Guide Granny",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@str$"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugel Guide Granny]\nI also like playing Monster Race games. It is pretty fun, you know?\nOh, you haven't tried it yet? No~ you'd better try. Trust me, you will like it.\n{0}",
      "translation" : "[毁葛向导婆婆]\n魔物赛跑我也爱玩，可有意思了！\n什么，你还没试过？\n那可不行~一定要玩玩，相信我，你会喜欢的。\n{0}"
    },
